cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Replication materials for \"From antenatal pertussis vaccine effectiveness to infant population impact\""
message: >-
  These are the public replication materials for a Letter to the Editor
  submitted to the Journal of Infection in response to Walker et al. (2026).
abstract: >-
  Replication materials linking published antenatal pertussis vaccine
  effectiveness estimates to observed English coverage through Farrington's
  screening identity, together with an age-structured transmission-model
  diagnostic of the same national coverage targets. Contains the analysis
  protocol, configuration, pipeline scripts, staged inputs with provenance
  hashes, derived figure and table ledgers, display figures and audit reports.
  The submitted manuscript text and the parent ODE engine are not included.
